{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Clicker - Macro,\u00a0</strong>makes repetitive clicking easy. Whether you need fast clicks for gaming or automated tasks for everyday use, this lightweight tool saves you time and effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Main Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic Clicking</strong> \u2013 Choose left or right click and let the app handle it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Intervals</strong> \u2013 Set your own delay between clicks for full control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite or Limited Clicks</strong> \u2013 Run until stopped or for a set number of clicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotkey Support</strong> \u2013 Start and stop instantly with your chosen shortcut.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightweight &amp; User-Friendly</strong> \u2013 Simple design that runs smoothly in the background.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to use</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After launch the app, set to key for start/stop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set x and y position from the menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy it.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044160?t=1758863553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044160/b20a36a7e104c060fb4a0c97e5df874b4844e79c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758863553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044160/abf83d10a89b5c8bbc0dd47171d819f571a51a5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758863553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044160/abf83d10a89b5c8bbc0dd47171d819f571a51a5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758863553","categories":[{"description":"Steam Achi